: 0.8033323938196356, "needs_review": false}, {"bbox": [[257.0, 775.0], [1239.0, 775.0], [1239.0, 798.0], [257.0, 798.0]], "text": "复合趋向补语的趋向意义用法：动词+出来／出去／过来／过去/回来／回去/进来／进去／起", "confidence": 0.8542974605116733, "needs_review": false}, {"bbox": [[257.0, 817.0], [548.0, 817.0], [548.0, 839.0], [257.0, 839.0]], "text": "来/上来／上去/下来/下去", "confidence": 0.8132297226360866, "needs_review": false}, {"bbox": [[256.0, 856.0], [556.0, 857.0], [556.0, 883.0], [256.0, 882.0]], "text": "他从书包里拿了一本书出来。", "confidence": 0.9035538733005524, "needs_review": false}, {"bbox": [[258.0, 901.0], [532.0, 901.0], [532.0, 924.0], [258.0, 924.0]], "text": "他从书包里拿出一本书来。", "confidence": 0.8257916936507592, "needs_review": false}, {"bbox": [[257.0, 943.0], [533.0, 943.0], [533.0, 966.0], [257.0, 966.0]], "text": "他从书包里拿出来一本书。", "confidence": 0.9194326033959022, "needs_review": false}, {"bbox": [[257.0, 983.0], [509.0, 983.0], [509.0, 1009.0], [257.0, 1009.0]], "text": "他慢慢地走出教室去了。", "confidence": 0.9041630576054255, "needs_review": false}, {"bbox": [[253.0, 1025.0], [570.0, 1023.0], [571.0, 1050.0], [253.0, 1052.0]], "text": "汽车开过来了，咱们准备上车", "confidence": 0.8636078153337751, "needs_review": false}, {"bbox": [[256.0, 1068.0], [546.0, 1067.0], [546.0, 1093.0], [256.0, 1094.0]], "text": "他在桥那边，我们走过去吧", "confidence": 0.8899845618468064, "needs_review": false}, {"bbox": [[256.0, 1109.0], [531.0, 1109.0], [531.0, 1135.0], [256.0, 1135.0]], "text": "我昨天买回来了一些水果。", "confidence": 0.9021060466766357, "needs_review": false}, {"bbox": [[254.0, 1151.0], [599.0, 1151.0], [599.0, 1177.0], [254.0, 1177.0]], "text": "这儿离学校很近，我们走回去吧。", "confidence": 0.9230214655399323, "needs_review": false}, {"bbox": [[257.0, 1196.0], [559.0, 1196.0], [559.0, 1219.0], [257.0, 1219.0]], "text": "外边的桌子你搬进来了没有？", "confidence": 0.8457530268601009, "needs_review": false}, {"bbox": [[257.0, 1239.0], [458.0, 1235.0], [458.0, 1259.0], [257.0, 1262.0]], "text": "桌子我还没搬进来。", "confidence": 0.8556097745895386, "needs_review": false}, {"bbox": 